 "ood": {
  "signal_formula": "descriptors v (46): 42 classifier features, Intensity (Freq), Intensity (RMSSD_l1), acc_mean_norm = ||mean acc||, acc_norm_median = median_t ||acc_t||. For each descriptor f: lo_f = p0.5, hi_f = p99.5 of the training windows, w_f = max(hi_f - lo_f, 1e-6 + 1e-3*max(|lo_f|,|hi_f|)), e_f = max(0, lo_f - v_f, v_f - hi_f) / w_f; s_range = 1 - exp(-max_f(e_f) / 0.5). Gravity direction: if ||mean acc|| >= 1 m/s^2, theta = angle in degrees from the unit vector of the mean acceleration to the nearest training-window unit vector; s_gravity = clip((theta - theta_ok) / 30, 0, 1) with theta_ok = 99th percentile of the leave-one-participant-out theta rounded up to 5 degrees. ood_signal = max(s_range, s_gravity); windows containing NaN/inf score 1.",
  "demographic_formula": "z_age = max(0, age_min - age, age - age_max) / age_sd; z_bmi = max(0, bmi_min - bmi, bmi - bmi_max) / bmi_sd (min/max/sd over the 26 training participants, sd with ddof=1); ood_demographic = 1 - exp(-sqrt(z_age^2 + z_bmi^2)); 1 if the sex does not occur in the training participants.",
